    "title": "Wild Sea Performance Hoodie",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Lightweight performance hoodie designed for long days under harsh saltwater sun. Breathable, quick-dry and built for inshore and offshore adventures.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">sun protection</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Lightweight and breathable fabric</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Quick-dry performance material</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Designed for offshore and inshore fishing</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Extremly durable tested in hard condition</p></li></ul><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Built for anglers who live beyhond the shoreline.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p>",
